## Definition of completion for any task
- Functional change **and** focused unit/integration tests delivered.
- No user Google ID token travels to FastAPI; internal calls use service identity.
- Ownership is derived from the verified session, never a browser-supplied `owner_key`.
- No duplicate Skill revisions in GCS; Agent Registry remains canonical.
- Failure paths, retries, redaction, and least-privilege behavior are covered.
- Claude Code reports filenames, changes, tests run, test failures, and unresolved review decisions.
- Do **not** deploy, mutate production data/IAM, or commit/push unless specifically asked.
